            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Well none of them actually do what we are looking for. They work for some particular cases like `searching` or `yanking`. \n\nGoing by their approaches, It will require to reimplement for all other `operator`. \n\nWhat we are looking is a way that can be `plug in the effect` for every editing command.\n",
