            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/16296 is related. But for this issue, we can do something pretty inexpensive:\n\n# Proposal\n\n- Ensure that the `TextChanged` event indicates which region was changed, similar to `TextYankPost`, `TextPutPost` ([ref](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/39741))\n- Then `vim.hl.hl_op()` can highlight it. https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/39777",
