            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "From my understanding the TextChanged event occurs after the text is removed, which would prevent us from having this feature active for deletes and cuts. Does that sound accurate? Would an acceptable implementation be creating an event for after a command has been issued but prior to operating on text?",
